@startuml UC-24
' Use case: ../use-cases/UC-24.md
title UC-24: Remove from Wishlist
footer Feature WISH-02 | Business rules: BR-08, BR-18
autonumber
hide footbox
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor "Customer" as U
participant "Daisy.Mvc" as MVC
participant "WishlistController" as API <<Daisy.Api>>
participant "WishlistService" as SVC <<Daisy.Application>>
database "DaisyDbContext" as DB <<SQL Server>>

U -> MVC : Click "Remove" on a wishlist product
MVC -> API : DELETE /api/wishlist/{productId}
API -> SVC : RemoveAsync(currentUserId, productId)
SVC -> DB : Find Wishlist (UserId = current user, ProductId) (BR-08)
opt found
  SVC -> DB : Delete Wishlist\nSaveChangesAsync
end
SVC --> API : OK
API --> MVC : 204 No Content
MVC --> U : Remove product from the list

@enduml
